{"id": "b10-en", "slot": 10, "lang": "en", "category": "pairing", "assertion": "deterministic", "hard": false, "trial": null, "question": "Which inverters work with the GW9.0-BAT-D-G20 battery?", "page": {"type": "other"}, "seconds": 15.9, "timing": {"understand": 3.198, "understand.vocabulary": 0.0, "understand.attachments": 0.0, "understand.jev": 3.02, "understand.call.linker/search-products": 0.178, "understand.calls": 0.178, "model.tool.linker/get-product": 0.127, "model.tool.linker/search-products": 0.407, "model.attempt_1": 12.443, "model": 12.443, "ground": 0.001, "hydrate": 0.0, "log": 0.002, "first_event": 15.646, "total": 15.646}, "verdict": "pass", "failures": [], "meta": {"turn_id": 416, "grounded": true, "fallback": false, "attempts": 1, "failures": [], "language": "en", "route": "products", "intent": "pairing_compatibility", "jev_error": null, "timing": {"understand": 3.198, "understand.vocabulary": 0.0, "understand.attachments": 0.0, "understand.jev": 3.02, "understand.call.linker/search-products": 0.178, "understand.calls": 0.178, "model.tool.linker/get-product": 0.127, "model.tool.linker/search-products": 0.407, "model.attempt_1": 12.443, "model": 12.443, "ground": 0.001, "hydrate": 0.0, "log": 0.002, "first_event": 15.646, "total": 15.646}}, "answer": "Each inverter below has a released pairing with the GW9.0-BAT-D-G20, so the battery can be combined with any of them under the conditions the GoodWe ESA documents state:\n\n### Single-phase ESA power modules\n- Documented for the G20 battery modules in the EMEA datasheet, for the GW3K–10K-EHA-G20 power module range.\n- The G21 variants of that battery are not part of that table.\n\n### Three-phase ESA power modules\n- The ESA datasheet lists the G20 battery modules for these power modules.\n- The user manual adds the limit for one battery column and names the expansion kit for higher capacity or a lower column.\n\nApproved partner accounts see net prices on the product cards.", "blocks": [{"type": "text", "text": "Each inverter below has a released pairing with the GW9.0-BAT-D-G20, so the battery can be combined with any of them under the conditions the GoodWe ESA documents state:\n\n### Single-phase ESA power modules\n- Documented for the G20 battery modules in the EMEA datasheet, for the GW3K–10K-EHA-G20 power module range.\n- The G21 variants of that battery are not part of that table.\n\n### Three-phase ESA power modules\n- The ESA datasheet lists the G20 battery modules for these power modules.\n- The user manual adds the limit for one battery column and names the expansion kit for higher capacity or a lower column.\n\nApproved partner accounts see net prices on the product cards.", "refs": ["6523", "6524", "6525", "6526", "6527", "6528", "6513", "6512", "3583", "3556", "6514", "3584"]}, {"type": "cards", "product_ids": [6523, 6524, 6525, 6526, 6527, 6528, 6513, 6512, 3583, 3556, 6514, 3584], "prices": [{"product_id": 6523, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6524, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6525, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6526, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6527, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6528, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6513, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6512, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 3583, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 3556, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6514, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 3584, "text": "Net price after partner sign-in", "reason": "login"}]}, {"type": "document", "ref": "p3612.document.0", "label": "GoodWe ESA Series 5–30 kW Datasheet (EN)", "url": "http://127.0.0.1:9177/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GW_ESA-5-30kW_Datasheet-EN.pdf"}, {"type": "document", "ref": "p3612.document.1", "label": "GW ESA-5-30kW User-Manual-EN V1.5", "url": "http://127.0.0.1:9177/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GW_ESA-5-30kW_User-Manual-EN_V1.5.pdf"}, {"type": "ask", "field": "phase", "options": ["single-phase", "three-phase"]}], "wp": "http://127.0.0.1:9177"}
{"id": "b10-de", "slot": 10, "lang": "de", "category": "pairing", "assertion": "deterministic", "hard": false, "trial": null, "question": "Mit welchen Wechselrichtern funktioniert die Batterie GW9.0-BAT-D-G20?", "page": {"type": "other"}, "seconds": 27.3, "timing": {"understand": 3.012, "understand.vocabulary": 0.0, "understand.attachments": 0.0, "understand.jev": 2.751, "understand.call.linker/search-products": 0.259, "understand.calls": 0.26, "model.tool.linker/search-products": 0.988, "model.tool.linker/get-product": 0.453, "model.attempt_1": 11.457, "model": 24.06, "ground": 0.001, "model.attempt_2": 12.603, "hydrate": 0.0, "log": 0.002, "first_event": 27.077, "total": 27.077}, "verdict": "pass", "failures": [], "meta": {"turn_id": 417, "grounded": true, "fallback": false, "attempts": 2, "failures": [], "language": "de", "route": "products", "intent": "pairing_compatibility", "jev_error": null, "timing": {"understand": 3.012, "understand.vocabulary": 0.0, "understand.attachments": 0.0, "understand.jev": 2.751, "understand.call.linker/search-products": 0.259, "understand.calls": 0.26, "model.tool.linker/search-products": 0.988, "model.tool.linker/get-product": 0.453, "model.attempt_1": 11.457, "model": 24.06, "ground": 0.001, "model.attempt_2": 12.603, "hydrate": 0.0, "log": 0.002, "first_event": 27.077, "total": 27.077}}, "answer": "### Einphasige ESA-Leistungsmodule\nDiese Leistungsmodule haben ein dokumentiertes, freigegebenes Pairing mit dem Batteriemodul GW9.0-BAT-D-G20:\n- GW3K-EHA-G20\n- GW3.6K-EHA-G20\n- GW5K-EHA-G20\n- GW6K-EHA-G20\n- GW8K-EHA-G20\n- GW10K-EHA-G20\n\n### Dreiphasige ESA-Leistungsmodule\nAuch diese Leistungsmodule sind für das Batteriemodul freigegeben:\n- GW5K-ETA-G20\n- GW6K-ETA-G20\n- GW8K-ETA-G20\n- GW10K-ETA-G20\n- GW9.999K-ETA-G20\n- GW12K-ETA-G20\n\n### Bedingungen aus der Pairing-Unterlage\n- Die Batteriemodule der G20-Baureihe sind für die Leistungsmodule der ESA-Reihe genannt; die G21-Varianten stehen nicht in dieser Tabelle.\n- Für die einphasige ESA nennt das EMEA-Datenblatt ausdrücklich die G20-Module.\n- Das Benutzerhandbuch begrenzt die Anzahl der Batterien pro Säule und nennt ein Batterie-Erweiterungsset für mehr Kapazität oder eine niedrigere Säule.\n\nFreigegebene Partnerkonten sehen die Nettopreise auf den Produktkarten.", "blocks": [{"type": "text", "text": "### Einphasige ESA-Leistungsmodule\nDiese Leistungsmodule haben ein dokumentiertes, freigegebenes Pairing mit dem Batteriemodul GW9.0-BAT-D-G20:\n- GW3K-EHA-G20\n- GW3.6K-EHA-G20\n- GW5K-EHA-G20\n- GW6K-EHA-G20\n- GW8K-EHA-G20\n- GW10K-EHA-G20\n\n### Dreiphasige ESA-Leistungsmodule\nAuch diese Leistungsmodule sind für das Batteriemodul freigegeben:\n- GW5K-ETA-G20\n- GW6K-ETA-G20\n- GW8K-ETA-G20\n- GW10K-ETA-G20\n- GW9.999K-ETA-G20\n- GW12K-ETA-G20\n\n### Bedingungen aus der Pairing-Unterlage\n- Die Batteriemodule der G20-Baureihe sind für die Leistungsmodule der ESA-Reihe genannt; die G21-Varianten stehen nicht in dieser Tabelle.\n- Für die einphasige ESA nennt das EMEA-Datenblatt ausdrücklich die G20-Module.\n- Das Benutzerhandbuch begrenzt die Anzahl der Batterien pro Säule und nennt ein Batterie-Erweiterungsset für mehr Kapazität oder eine niedrigere Säule.\n\nFreigegebene Partnerkonten sehen die Nettopreise auf den Produktkarten.", "refs": ["6523", "6524", "6525", "6526", "6527", "6528", "6513", "6512", "3583", "3556", "6514", "3584"]}, {"type": "cards", "product_ids": [6523, 6524, 6525, 6526, 6527, 6528, 6513, 6512, 3583, 3556, 6514, 3584], "prices": [{"product_id": 6523, "text": "Nettopreis nach Partner-Anmeldung", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6524, "text": "Nettopreis nach Partner-Anmeldung", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6525, "text": "Nettopreis nach Partner-Anmeldung", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6526, "text": "Nettopreis nach Partner-Anmeldung", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6527, "text": "Nettopreis nach Partner-Anmeldung", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6528, "text": "Nettopreis nach Partner-Anmeldung", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6513, "text": "Nettopreis nach Partner-Anmeldung", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6512, "text": "Nettopreis nach Partner-Anmeldung", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 3583, "text": "Nettopreis nach Partner-Anmeldung", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 3556, "text": "Nettopreis nach Partner-Anmeldung", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 6514, "text": "Nettopreis nach Partner-Anmeldung", "reason": "login"}, {"product_id": 3584, "text": "Nettopreis nach Partner-Anmeldung", "reason": "login"}]}, {"type": "document", "ref": "p3612.document.1", "label": "GW ESA-5-30kW User-Manual-EN V1.5", "url": "http://127.0.0.1:9177/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GW_ESA-5-30kW_User-Manual-EN_V1.5.pdf"}], "wp": "http://127.0.0.1:9177"}
